  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.21 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.36. LTX-2 19B, video WITH sound from one model, on desktop GPUs, reading ComfyUI's own files (the fp8 checkpoint streamed block by block, the NVFP4 / fp8 Gemma 3 12B, the distilled LoRA) and checked stage by stage against ComfyUI's own runs: Ltx2Pipeline (prompt to clip with sound; the distilled 8 steps or 20 steps with CFG), keyframe guides (image to video, several keyframes, strengths, masks), Gemma3TextEncoder, Ltx2Transformer / Ltx2AvModel, Ltx2Schedule, the video and audio VAEs, the vocoder, the x2 latent upscaler, Ltx2Lora with an opt-in mode that reproduces ComfyUI's seeded fp8 re-rounding of LoRA-patched weights. NVFP4 weights; streamed weights prefetch the next block. Fixes: SentencePiece BPE now applies real merges (Gemma / llama / mistral vocabularies), the CUDA precise-activation GEMM no longer loses accuracy with long sums, the tiled GEMM's gathered rows with BF16 weights. See CHANGELOG.md.",
